[0.301, "o", "\r\n>>> What are the key new features in Python 3.13?\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;120;129;145m\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.304, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[38;2;145;132;174m\u001b[1m[REQUIREMENTS]\u001b[0m Extracting completion criteria...\r\n"]
[24.342, "o", "  \u001b[38;2;145;132;174m\u001b[1m[REQUIREMENTS]\u001b[0m 1 criteria, answer_mode=roundup\r\n    1. Identify features that are new to Python 3.13\r\n"]
[0.306, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[38;2;112;143;181m\u001b[1m[PLAN]\u001b[0m Breaking down: What are the key new features in Python 3.13?\r\n"]
[23.385, "o", "  \u001b[38;2;112;143;181m\u001b[1m[PLAN]\u001b[0m 3 steps:\r\n    1. web_search: What's new in Python 3.13 official documentation\r\n    2. web_search: Python 3.13 release notes changelog\r\n    3. web_search: Python 3.13 new features summary\r\n"]
[0.306, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[38;2;105;157;164m\u001b[1m[EXEC]\u001b[0m Deferring 1 web_search step(s) to the next round\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;2;105;157;164m\u001b[1m[EXEC]\u001b[0m Batch (2 steps, concurrency=1, 12s apart (scraper)):\r\n"]
